WEBVTT

00:10:27.247 --> 00:10:30.000
align with what works
for people and planet.

00:10:31.251 --> 00:10:35.506
We must collectively create
a food ecosystem

00:10:35.547 --> 00:10:39.426
that works not just for us
but for future generations.

00:10:40.094 --> 00:10:43.597
Our children and grandchildren
will hold us accountable

00:10:43.639 --> 00:10:46.266
for what we chose to do today

00:10:46.308 --> 00:10:48.519
to transform the food ecosystem.

00:10:48.560 --> 00:10:49.770
Thank you so much.

00:10:49.770 --> 00:10:55.859
(Applause)